## ==============================================================================
## MADVerse - Local Configuration Template
## ==============================================================================
## Copy this file to 'local.properties' in your project root or add the following keys.
## 'local.properties' is strictly git-ignored and MUST NEVER be committed to Git.
##
## 1. TMDB API Key:
##    Get your key from https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api
TMDB_API_KEY=your_tmdb_api_key_here
##
## 2. Google Gemini API Key (Optional AI recommendation layer):
##    Get your key from https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
##
## 3. Android SDK location (Usually auto-generated by Android Studio):
## sdk.dir=C\:\\Users\\<username>\\AppData\\Local\\Android\\Sdk
